# metadata field definitions for prxml-extract-metadata.py

# key to prefixes:
# prefixes consist of 3 parts, delimited by underscores
# 
# part 1:
# c_: generated by GB at CCH
# o_: generated by Olive system
# n_: generated my manual entry by NCSE team
# 
# part 2:
# toc_: information derived from TOC.xml file
# ent_: information derived from various entity/article XML files
# 
# part 3:
# meta_: information derived from attributes in first "meta" element
# enty_: information derived from attributes in entity element
# appd_: information derived from sub-elements and attributes of
#        Application_Data / Application_Info elements
# sect_: information derived from attributes in section element
# page_: information derived from attributes in page element
# 

